      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "When you are in this much pain, the idea of an ending can feel like the only logical or peaceful conclusion. It's natural to feel exhausted by the effort of continuing when the pain feels permanent. However, a quiet ending is not the only conclusion available; persistent feelings of hopelessness can be symptoms that we can treat and change. Please let someone professional help you explore alternative conclusions to your story.",
